    <item>
      <title>贝佐斯“神隐”三年，携441亿巨款空降AI“神秘组织”：0产品，无官网，却已挖空谷歌OpenAI？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/441ai0openai-20251118081005523-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 08:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
